#: 9e1987f0c03a40d9a619e1e24b6fb094
msgid ""
"for example, to set this option to ignore receiver failsafe bits, you would "
"set bit 2, or a value of \"4\" (2^2=4). This may be useful when using ground"
" station control beyond the range of the RC system which can set its "
"receiver's outputs to trim values upon RC signal loss, but still has a "
"failsafe bit in the protocol which would otherwise force an RC failsafe to "
"occur."
msgstr ""
"例如，要将此选项设置为忽略接收机失控保护位，应设置 bit 2，即数值 "
"\"4\"（2^2=4）。当使用超出遥控系统作用范围的地面站控制时，这可能很有用：此时接收机可在遥控信号丢失时将其输出设为回中值，但协议中仍带有失控保护位，否则将强制触发遥控失控保护。"
